    "Params: (cols: Column*)\n\nResult: Column\n\nCreates a new array column. The input columns must all have the same data type.\n\n\n1.4.0\n\nSource: https://spark.apache.org/docs/3.0.1/api/scala/org/apache/spark/sql/functions$.html\n\nTimestamp: 2020-10-19T01:56:22.184Z",
