    :checkpoint
    "Params: (directory: String)\n\nResult: Unit\n\nSets the context to periodically checkpoint the DStream operations for master\nfault-tolerance. The graph will be checkpointed every batch interval.\n\nHDFS-compatible directory where the checkpoint data will be reliably stored\n\nSource: https://spark.apache.org/docs/3.0.1/api/scala/org/apache/spark/streaming/api/java/JavaStreamingContext.html\n\nTimestamp: 2020-10-19T01:56:50.542Z",
